# Why a pane's process list could not be read or acted on.

error-processes-answer = Herdr's answer about the pane's process was not understood.
error-processes-busy = Still ending the last processes. Try again in a moment.
error-processes-executable = The herdr executable's path is not valid UTF-8.
error-processes-no-root = Herdr did not name a process for this pane.
error-processes-query = Could not ask Herdr which process the pane runs.
error-processes-root-exited = The pane's process has exited.
error-processes-stopped = The process list stopped updating. Reopen it to try again.
error-processes-worker = Could not start watching the pane's processes.
